      "content": "hey, i think my credit union is basically trying to push me out of my account. i keep getting these random small fees that dont make sense and my debit card got declined for something that should have been fine. it feels like they're purposely trying to bleed my balance dry so i have to close it. do you know how i can protect my money from them? i need some ways to fight back or move things so they cant just liquidate me.",
